		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Legendary eagles with a 100- foot wingspan and a coyote's head. Immortal unless slain, often regarded as definitive lore-keepers for a region.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 57, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 rend +9 (2d10 + grab) or 2 eye ray (far) +9 (2d10) or banish, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> L, <strong>LV</strong> 12</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Banish</strong>. All extradimensional creatures within near CHA 15+ or sent back to their home planes.</p><p></p><p><strong>Grab</strong>. STR 18+ or target held. STR 18+ on turn to break free.</p><p></p><p><strong>Peace Aura</strong>. All mortals within double hear, CHA 15+ or cannot take hostile actions.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
